v 3
d center2: fast replacement for center (Rust plugin)
d
d center2 centers (or standardizes) variables, optionally by group, with the results and messages
d of center by Ben Jann (SSC). As in Stata's destring and tostring, replace changes variables in
d place (center's inplace) and force overwrites existing variables (center's replace). It adds by()
d for grouping unsorted data without sorting, and threads(). The computation is a compiled Rust
d plugin (Linux, macOS, Windows).
d
d Author: Leo Liu, auleo.liu@gmail.com
d License: MIT
d Distribution-Date: 20261015
